{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2023-01-10 09:47:00', 'title': "DOW NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST JUST COMPANIES FOR THE FOURTH YEAR BY JUST CAPITAL", 'text': 'EARNS THE 55TH OVERALL POSITION IN 2023 AND THE TOP SPOT FOR COMMUNITIES IN THE CHEMICALS SECTOR MIDLAND, MICH. , JAN. 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOW (NYSE: DOW) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT FOR THE FOURTH YEAR IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE JUST 100 LIST – PLACING 55TH OVERALL, AN 11-POINT IMPROVEMENT FROM LAST YEAR AND SECURING THE TOP SPOT FOR COMMUNITIES IN THE CHEMICALS SECTOR.'}